[2.428415,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  A safety window for a remote change\r\n  ==================================\r\n\r\n  This running Ze starts as edge-original. We use its actual SSH editor.\r\n  Junos commit confirmed uses minutes and confirms with commit.\r\n  Ze uses seconds and commit accept. Here the window is eight seconds.\r\n"]
